@startuml
!include style.iuml
title AI subsystem in the Fire Detection System (system context)


actor "Forest\n(smoke, fire, fog,\nsteam, sunlight)" as Env
actor "Ranger /\nDashboard user" as User

node "Fire detection node (tree-mounted, solar powered)" as Node {
  rectangle "Sensor array\nMQ-7, MQ-9, MQ-135,\nMH-Z19 CO2, BME280,\nflame sensor" as Sensors
  component "Arduino MKR WAN 1300\nsensor hub + **fusion logic**\n+ LoRa radio" as MKR #FFE0B2
  component "ESP32-CAM\n**on-device image classifier**\n(MobileNetV1 int8)" as CAM #C8E6C9
}

cloud "The Things Network\n(LoRaWAN, OTAA)" as TTN
node "Ubuntu server (EduCloud)" as Srv {
  component "Backend / API" as API
  database "Database\nreadings, alarms" as DB
  component "Website dashboard" as Web
}

Env --> Sensors : gas, heat,\nflame (IR)
Env --> CAM : light (images)
Sensors --> MKR : analog / I2C /\nUART / digital
MKR --> CAM : "CAPTURE" (UART)
CAM --> MKR : "RESULT,label,conf,votes"
MKR --> TTN : 12-byte payload\n(alarm, heartbeat)
TTN --> API : webhook / MQTT
API --> DB
DB --> Web
Web --> User : alarm, AI label,\nconfidence, sensor values

note bottom of CAM
  Images never leave the camera
  (NFR04, SEC8). Only a label,
  a confidence and a vote count.
end note
@enduml
